Z||000000||Spektrum-87GT||08-27-2001||06:26 PM||||well... the windows move up and down... but slowly, takes around 15-20 seconds one way. and you have to click the unlock/lock button 3 times for it to fully engage. any idea of whats wrong? also, the door glass is scratching, but i'm pretty sure thats because of the worn/VERY hard and cracked window stripping. thanks in advance.||||reg||1
Z||000001||PBJ||08-27-2001||08:26 PM||||All normal characteristic of a old car.<P>First I would remove the inner door pannel and lubricate any thing that moves including lock rods-this should help, if it doesn't<P>second. replace worn out power window mtrs and power door lock actuators.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/forsalestart.jpg"> ||||reg||1
